WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.702
AI agents now issue refunds, run commands,

2
00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:05.223
and change production.

3
00:00:05.223 --> 00:00:06.812
When one gets it wrong,

4
00:00:06.812 --> 00:00:08.955
the only record is its own log,

5
00:00:08.955 --> 00:00:12.910
written by the same process that made the mistake.

6
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.703
agent-custody puts a gateway between your agents and their tools,

7
00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:23.137
and gives every call a signed receipt that anyone can verify.

8
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.188
A person signs a grant.

9
00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:29.589
The gateway checks every call against it and a policy,

10
00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:30.912
before the tool runs.

11
00:00:30.912 --> 00:00:33.305
Allowed or denied, it signs a receipt,

12
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:39.157
and the receipt's hash goes into a Merkle log that anyone can check with public keys.

13
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.258
Here it is at work.

14
00:00:42.258 --> 00:00:43.488
Maya runs support.

15
00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:45.880
She signs a grant for her AI agent:

16
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.067
refunds up to a thousand pounds,

17
00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:50.480
only for verified customers.

18
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.581
Alex asks for a refund.

19
00:00:53.581 --> 00:00:55.474
The gateway checks the grant,

20
00:00:55.474 --> 00:00:57.367
looks the customer up itself,

21
00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.868
and applies the policy.

22
00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.174
Five hundred pounds?

23
00:01:00.174 --> 00:01:01.261
Approved.

24
00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:05.361
Then someone slips a line into a ticket,

25
00:01:05.361 --> 00:01:07.486
and the agent tries five thousand.

26
00:01:07.486 --> 00:01:08.799
The agent was fooled.

27
00:01:08.799 --> 00:01:10.487
The gateway wasn't.

28
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.226
Every call gets a signed receipt,

29
00:01:14.226 --> 00:01:17.074
and every field says who vouches for it.

30
00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.539
Months later,

31
00:01:19.539 --> 00:01:23.550
an auditor checks it with public keys and a copy of the log.

32
00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.152
No login.

33
00:01:24.152 --> 00:01:26.123
No trust in the agent.

34
00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.613
agent-custody.

35
00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:31.218
Proof of what your AI agents did.
